__pycache__
.venv
solr
*.mp3
*.zip
node_modules
data
books
*.7z
movie_index
lucene
pdfs
# The `lucene` rule above ignores locally downloaded Lucene jars/indexes, but the ch04
# exercise ships a student-facing Lucene project skeleton that must be published. Its own
# .gitignore keeps its build output (target/) out.
!exercises/**/lucene/

# Per-page PDF/Markdown download artifacts in the built book: the theme's download
# menu is hidden via custom CSS, so these are never reachable by users. Chapter PDFs
# users do get are served from publish/chapters/ (linked in the README).
publish/book/build/*.pdf
publish/book/build/*.md
# The bare data rule above ignores downloaded datasets, but demo images (ch06-01 color
# histograms) are small, committed inputs that students need.
!demos/data/
demos/data/*
!demos/data/images/
# Recorded agent runs (ch07-04, ch07-05): replayed offline when there is no AWS access.
!demos/data/ch07/
# Pinned Wikipedia excerpt (ch08-01 proximity): fixed revision, so positions match the book.
!demos/data/ch08/
